{"unit_id":"wanted09527__dsh-progress-caption#card-zh","repo":"wanted09527/dsh-progress-caption","commit":"4316bb90a31ed30fecd278ed7fe55c16cc8e652d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress-caption 是 DSH Web 客户端插件，会在输入框上方显示当前思考步骤、工具动作以及成功或失败状态。它通过会话快照识别运行中的工具、推理文本和回合结果，并把字幕注入输入框停靠区，也在回合尾部提供小结。字幕可显示工具目标和思考摘句，状态文案由本地规则生成；设置面板支持字号、颜色、动画和俏皮词偏好。适合希望快速了解 DSH 当前处理进度的用户；不需要 API 密钥或额外服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1171-1245","client.js:2719-2749"]}
{"unit_id":"wanted09527__dsh-progress-caption#card-en","repo":"wanted09527/dsh-progress-caption","commit":"4316bb90a31ed30fecd278ed7fe55c16cc8e652d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-progress-caption is a DSH Web plugin showing reasoning and tool progress above the composer. It reads session snapshots to caption tools and turn outcomes, and adds a turn summary. Local rules generate captions; settings control size, color, animation, and rotating words. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1171-1245","client.js:2719-2749"]}
